    "policy": "Independent inclusive bounded LRU tiers. Compute missing suffix after contiguous P hit and peer extension. Fill the completed prompt into hot P and conditionally into the peer; all writes precede the next request with delay 0. Tier writes on a hit touch the existing block without charging another transfer.",
